You calculate it the same way you calculate digamma -- you use the recurrence relation to relate phi(x) to phi(x') where x' >> 1 (10 would be more than enough, I believe 5 or 6 is recommended in the literature) and then use the Laurent expansion for phi(x), x >> 1.

