From ua5e83218c834e013 at groups.google.com  Thu Jun 13 20:58:08 2013
From: ua5e83218c834e013 at groups.google.com (Michael Betancourt)
Date: Thu, 13 Jun 2013 20:58:08 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-dev] Chain Ensembles
Message-ID: <nPec2hoHAuc.z4gg55Z_tX4J@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <nPec2hoHAuc.ghBnIxG1wbYJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
References: <nPec2hoHAuc.ghBnIxG1wbYJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-dev/c/nPec2hoHAuc/m/z4gg55Z_tX4J>
